      "start": 40.268,
      "end": 42.856,
      "duration": 2.588,
      "gain_db": -0.14,
      "gap_before": 0.204
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "คุณกดปุ่มระฆัง… แต่ยังไม่มีใครตอบเลย!",
      "start": 43.069,
      "end": 45.665,
      "duration": 2.596,
      "gain_db": 0.3,
      "gap_before": 0.213
    },
    {
